{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37233","headline":"观锡宴 · 章谒","name":"观锡宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倾朝朱紫正骈阗，红杏青莎映广筵。\n不道楼台无锦绣，只愁尘土扑神仙。\n鱼衔嫩草浮池面，蝶趂飞花到酒边。\n日暮骅骝相拥去，几人沉醉失金鞭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}